  <cac:ProcurementProject>
    <cbc:ID>25211</cbc:ID>
    
    <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">Electrician services, framework agreement.</cbc:Name>
    
    <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The competition is for framework agreements for electrician services for respectively Marker municipality and Aremark municipality.
One agreement will be established for each municipality.

Participants in the procurement municipalities Aremark and Marker.

The estimated value per annum and the maximum value for the entire contract period per zone, including any options and the expected price rise are stated in point 1.1.4.
The need is uncertain. The volume can vary both up and down and the contract period will depend on, among other things, the contracting authority ́s needs, activities, budgetary situations and other framework factors.

See the procurement documents for further information.

The contracting authority reserves the right to cancel the competition, i.a. in connection with budgetary coverage.

The obligation to make requirements for apprentices is considered to apply for this procurement, cf. the Procurement Act §7. See the attached seriousness terms for further information.</cbc:Description>
    <cbc:ProcurementTypeCode listName="contract-nature">services</cbc:ProcurementTypeCode>
